#ASSERT `Have I been given reasons in time` FALSE (`d` 10 9 2026) 0 TRUE (`d` 8 10 2026) (`d` 1 12 2026) EQUALS `given in time (s 46(1))`
#ASSERT `Have I been given reasons in time` FALSE (`d` 10 9 2026) 0 TRUE (`d` 9 10 2026) (`d` 1 12 2026) EQUALS `given, but after the period in s 46(1) ended`
