#ASSERT `Can my proceeding be struck out for the fee` `lodged` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 5 3 2026) EQUALS `no: the fee was reduced and I paid the reduced fee within the 30 days (s 68(4)(b))`
