#ASSERT `Can my proceeding be struck out for the fee` `lodged` TRUE (`d` 30 6 2026) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 30 6 2026) EQUALS `not yet: the date set for paying my postponed fee has not passed (s 68(5))`
#ASSERT `Can my proceeding be struck out for the fee` `lodged` TRUE (`d` 30 6 2026) FALSE `any day` FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) EQUALS `yes: VCAT may strike out my proceeding, as my postponed fee was not paid by the date set for payment (s 68(5))`
