#ASSERT `Does the settlement offer comply` `EO` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 14 EQUALS `not covered: sections 112 to 115 do not apply to a proceeding under the Equal Opportunity Act 2010 (Sch 1 cl 22)`

