#ASSERT `What is the last day to apply for leave to appeal` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) TRUE (`d` 20 8 2026) EQUALS JUST (`d` 17 9 2026)
#ASSERT `What is the last day to apply for leave to appeal` TRUE (`d` 1 7 2026) FALSE `any day` EQUALS NOTHING
