#ASSERT `Did I apply for leave to appeal in time` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) FALSE `any day` (`d` 30 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did I apply for leave to appeal in time` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) TRUE (`d` 20 8 2026) (`d` 17 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did I apply for leave to appeal in time` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) TRUE (`d` 20 8 2026) (`d` 18 9 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did I apply for leave to appeal in time` FALSE (`d` 1 7 2026) FALSE `any day` (`d` 30 6 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Did I apply for leave to appeal in time` TRUE (`d` 1 7 2026) FALSE `any day` (`d` 29 7 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

