#ASSERT `Did I institute my appeal in time` (`d` 10 11 2026) (`d` 24 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Did I institute my appeal in time` (`d` 10 11 2026) (`d` 25 11 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

